 "summary": "The new `TauCeti.sum_eq_sum_image_fiber` is not covered by any existing Mathlib or TauCeti declaration: Mathlib's only subtype-fibre regrouping, `Fintype.sum_fiberwise`, requires `[Fintype \u03ba]`, and the filter-indexed alternatives (`Finset.sum_fiberwise_of_maps_to`, `Finset.sum_image'`) do not produce the subtype-indexed inner sum the two consumers need. It factors a genuine duplication across the two composition proofs, and no further near-clone of the pattern is left unconverted.",
